# Great Train Heist, third mode ({R} + {R}): "Choose target opponent. Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to that player this turn, create a tapped Treasure token" (CR 603.7).
# Cast before combat on turn 3 with a Mox Ruby and a Mountain. Memnite and Bile-Vial Boggart attack and Bot2's Ornithopter blocks Memnite: Memnite's damage goes to the Ornithopter, so only the
# unblocked Boggart makes a tapped Treasure (Bot2 19). On turn 5 the Boggart connects again but the delayed trigger ended with turn 3: still one (now untapped) Treasure (Bot2 18).
[Bot1 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Bile-Vial Boggart
Mountain
Great Train Heist
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

